pe="String">userId=&quot;11111111-...&quot;;&#10;Items=[{ WasteCategoryId=plasticId, EstimatedWeightKg=4.99 }]</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Return: null&#10;Exception: BusinessRuleException (&quot;BR-HND-01&quot;, &quot;MSG-GEN-01&quot;)&#10;Log Message: &quot;Khối lượng tối thiểu cơ sở thu gom nhận là 5 kg cho mỗi loại.&quot;</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Boundary</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-04</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Kiểm tra biên dưới khối lượng phế liệu tối thiểu (w &lt; price.MinQuantityKg)</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="64"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC007</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Cơ sở quy định plastic có MinQuantityKg = 5.0 kg; người dùng nhập đúng 5.00 kg và đính kèm đúng 1 ảnh</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">userId=&quot;11111111-...&quot;;&#10;Items=[{ WasteCategoryId=plasticId, EstimatedWeightKg=5.00 }];&#10;PhotoUrls=[&quot;https://r2.../p1.jpg&quot;]</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Return: HandoverRequestDto { TotalEstimatedWeightKg = 5.00, PhotoUrls.Count = 1 }&#10;Exception: N/A&#10;Log Message: N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Boundary</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-04</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57