eKm &gt; Basic[1].DistanceKm)</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Normal</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-23</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">INC-2026-TST-12</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC004_ProSubscriptionEntitlement_GrantsVerifiedBadgeAndFeaturedGeoSort_Normal] R-07, U-05 Geo Sort — Cô lập tọa độ Đà Nẵng khắc phục flaky test _demoSeedChecked (INC-2026-TST-12)</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="64"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC005</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Đơn PREMIUM Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Gửi 3 lần cùng VietQrWebhookPayload (FT_IDEMPOTENT_999)</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Lần 1 &quot;PAID&quot;, lần 2 &amp; 3 &quot;ALREADY_PROCESSED&quot;, chỉ tạo 1 UserSubscription</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Normal</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-17</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC005_DuplicateWebhookDelivery_ActivatesSubscriptionExactlyOnce_Normal] BR-PAY-02 Idempotency</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="64"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC006</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Recycler Verified