Data ss:Type="String">UTC020</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Đã có User đạt cây cấp 2 (chưa ai đạt cấp 4)</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">DeleteAsync trên Fact cấp 2 và Fact cấp 4</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Fact cấp 2 chuyển INACTIVE (giữ lịch sử mở khóa); Fact cấp 4 xóa cứng</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Boundary</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-19</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC020_EcoFactService_DeleteAsync_ShouldSoftDeactivateIfUnlockedAndHardDeleteOtherwise] S-09, BR-GAM-06</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="64"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC021</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Có EcoFact ACTIVE gắn UnlockTreeLevel = 4</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UpdateAsync cắt TreeLevels xuống chỉ còn 2 cấp</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Ném BusinessRuleException (&quot;BR-GAM-06&quot;, &quot;MSG-AUTH-02&quot;) bảo vệ cấp đang có Fact</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Abnormal</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-19</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC021_GamificationConfigService_WhenRemovingLevelWithActiveEcoFact_ShouldThrowBRGam06] A-07 khóa xóa cấp đang dùng</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="64"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC022</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Khởi tạo 4 Validators &amp; GamSettings</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Input hợp lệ vs sai cho Gift, EcoFact, Config nhảy cóc cấp 1-&gt;3, Cycle &amp; Streak 20 ngày</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Validator chặn toàn bộ input sai, formula kẹp trần 5 + min(19*2, 10) = 15đ</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Abnormal</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-19</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC022_GamificationValidators_AndCheckinFormula_ShouldValidatePayloadsCorrectly] FluentValidation &amp; Formula</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="78"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC023</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">User có cây cấp 2 với HydrationPercent = 75, LastHydrationAt = UtcNow - 40h (suy giảm -2%/giờ -&gt; 0%)</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">GetAsync(user.Id), CareAsync(&quot;fertilize&quot;) khi héo, CareAsync(&quot;water&quot;) x3 (0%-&gt;35%-&gt;70%-&gt;100%), reset DailyWaterCount = 0 và CareAsync(&quot;water&quot;) ở 100%</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Cây giữ nguyên cấp 2 (BR-GAM-06), IsWilted = true; chặn bón phân khi héo (MSG-GEN-01); tưới lần 1 hồi sinh 35% (+10 EXP); chạm ngưỡng bão hòa &gt;= 95% bị chặn MSG-GEN-01</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Boundary</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-23</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC023_VirtualTreeService_WaterRevivesWiltedTree_AndRespectsSaturationGuard] U-15 suy giảm độ ẩm, hồi sinh cây héo &amp; chặn tưới bão hòa (&gt;= 95%)</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="92"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC024</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">User có cây cấp 2 (MaxCareExp = 100, HarvestReward = 20), HydrationPercent = 25</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">CareAsync(&quot;fertilize&quot;) khi độ ẩm &lt; 30%; chuỗi water (60%) -&gt; fertilize (+35 EXP) -&gt; water (85%) -&gt; fertilize (90 EXP) -&gt; water (100 EXP) -&gt; HarvestAsync</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Đất khô 25% &lt; 30% bị chặn (MSG-GEN-01); 60% vào vùng ẩm vàng (InOptimalHydrationZone=true); đạt 100 EXP bật HarvestReady=true; thu hoạch cộng +20đ ví (TotalHarvested=1, CareExp=0)</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Normal</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-23</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC024_VirtualTreeService_FertilizeOptimalZoneDryGuardAndHarvest_ShouldAwardWalletPointsUnderCap] U-15 chặn bón đất khô &lt; 30%, vùng ẩm vàng 60–90% &amp; thu hoạch</Data></Cell></Row><Row ss:Height="78"><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC025</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Có HandoverReceipt Completed (2 kg); User chưa dùng lượt bón phân ngày</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">AwardHandoverPointsAsync(receipt.Id) gọi 2 lần liên tiếp, sau đó CareAsync(&quot;fertilize&quot;) 3 lần trong ngày</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Idempotency: chỉ cộng FertilizerPacks = 2 (không cộng trùng lần 2); lượt 1 &amp; 2 dùng lượt miễn phí (DailyFertilizeCount = 2), lượt 3 tự tiêu thụ 1 túi phân (TotalFertilized = 3, FertilizerPacks = 1)</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Normal</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-23</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s57"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="s56"><Data ss:Type="String">[UTC025_VirtualTreeService_EcoActionsAwardFertilizerPacks_AndBypassFreeDailyLimit] Thưởng túi phân sau bàn giao (Idempotent) &amp; vượt giới hạn ngày</Data></Cell></Row></Table><WorksheetOptions xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel"><PageSetup><Header/><Footer/></PageSetup><TopRowVisible>0</TopRowVisible><LeftColumnVisible>0</LeftColumnVisible><PageBreakZoom>100</PageBreakZoom><ProtectObjects>False</ProtectObjects><ProtectScenarios>False</ProtectScenarios></WorksheetOptions></Worksheet><Worksheet ss:Name="14_Blog_Content"><Table ss:ExpandedColumnCount="12" ss:ExpandedRowCount="31" x:FullColumns="1" x:FullRows="1" ss:DefaultColumnWidth="48" ss:DefaultRowHeight="12.75"><Column ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="De